Suman Chakraborty, IIT Kharagpur. NPTEL Introduction to Fluid Mechanics and Fluid Engineering, course 112105183. [Official lecture sequence](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/112105183).

Use the complete public lecture sequence alongside the introductory books. Work the reasoning and examples independently, explaining properties, statics, kinematics, balances, similarity and viscous flow in your own physical system. Return to the relevant lecture when a later analytical step depends on its assumptions.

The official course identifies the instructor and institution. Course availability, individual-media terms and external textbook access are separate questions; retain NPTEL and credited-source notices. No complete assessment archive or software exercise is asserted without the actual corresponding material. All course media remain links.

